{"reviews":[{"id":"B073WVN4WV-0","r":3.0,"t":"It's okay but I don't love it. The colors are much lighter than they ...","x":"It's okay but I don't love it. The colors are much lighter than they appear, making application difficult. However, when finally applied, the shadows stay put without having to reapply.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-1","r":2.0,"t":"Colors Are Deceiving","x":"Disappointed in the color of the shadows in person vs. in photos online. On both my phone and PC the colors look soft and muted (the paler colors). In person they are vivid yellow and orange. The darker colors are very pretty and fine, but the light to medium shades are just bad.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-2","r":1.0,"t":"HORRIBLE DO BOT WASTE YOUR MONEY","x":"This was horrible the colors aren\u2019t even right it is not the real naked brand and, it smells disgusting.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-3","r":1.0,"t":"Looks are deceiving","x":"This product is garbage. It looks so nice in the picture, but you are not getting what you see. You can go to your corner drug store and get way better makeup than this. The dollar store probable even has this beat.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-4","r":4.0,"t":"Pretty good for the price","x":"Overall a good palette... I got the matte one and it has some nice colors and a mirror which is helpful. If you want good pigmentation apply with the applicator or your finger and only use a brush for blending.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-5","r":1.0,"t":"Not like the picture and came damaged.","x":"Finally got around to opening some packages I had piling up and to my surprise this does not look like the pictures. The eyeshadow colors are different and two of the colors came smudged as though they were used before. Don\u2019t waste your time with this brand or seller because you won\u2019t get what you paid for. I\u2019ll be returning this crap.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-6","r":1.0,"t":"Looked used","x":"I opened it and it looked used. There was purple in the white and all of them look like they had been sampled. Not only that but it had a strong baby wipe smell leading me to believe they wiped the product down and resold it. Very disappointed","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-7","r":2.0,"t":"Definitely not a repeat purchase?","x":"Not the best color pallet I\u2019ve ever seen or used?  Very dry, somewhat challenging to apply.  It\u2019s a cheap type eye shadow, I\u2019d definitely try others.  I tried once but this quickly went to the \u201cnon-use,\u201d box of makeup I keep.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-8","r":1.0,"t":"It stinks","x":"The makeup stinks like bug spray. I\u2019ve only used it a few times, and I can\u2019t handle it. I looked up some of the ingredients and nothing stood out as toxic.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-9","r":5.0,"t":"I do not use eye makeup much when it comes ...","x":"I do not use eye makeup much when it comes to eye shadow but I am loving this!  I needed to update my look for a wedding, might just stick with it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-10","r":3.0,"t":"Nice, but a little disappointed","x":"The quality of the shadow is good, but the colors are not what the picture is. It is always tricky buying shadows online without seeing them. Out of the many colors, I really use 3 of them.  The pink color is actually more of an orange color (which does NOT look good on me).  For the price, still worth the buy since about half the colors are  like the picture and they go on nicely.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-11","r":4.0,"t":"Warm Undertone - Good Product","x":"I really like the warm undertones of this product, and I am very satisfied with the results, however i find it difficult to apply with the brush given. The white does not have a strong pigment but the rest do, my most used is the pink/coral and the black. It's a simple pallet really good for an on the go eye shadow.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-12","r":5.0,"t":"10/10 would recomend","x":"Amazing and long lasting!! I bought the Matt and the Shimmer ones and everyone keeps talking about the colours!! They even smell like baby pouder... The combinations are endless!! I'm so in Love!!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-13","r":2.0,"t":"I was disappointed. Lots of fallout and low pigmentation","x":"I was disappointed. Lots of fallout and low pigmentation. I have honestly got better makup from the dollar store. It was worth a shot for the price but I would bot purchase this item again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-14","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect for \"Full-time working mom of kindergarten\" easy breezy and ...","x":"Perfect for &#34;Full-time working mom of kindergarten&#34; easy breezy and fast on full coverage foundation, mascara, the works and it doesn't smudge after getting off work.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-15","r":3.0,"t":"Get what you pay for...","x":"You get what you pay for in cosmetics. These aren\u2019t terrible but aren\u2019t very vivid or pigmented. Good for base color and blending but not for a lasting color effect.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-16","r":1.0,"t":"Counterfeit","x":"This is counterfeit. Do not buy!!!! Who knows what\u2019s in this make up but it can\u2019t be good. Poor quality and could cause safety concerns. Again - do not buy!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-17","r":1.0,"t":"I returned it","x":"It was orange-hued and too warm-based and it has a very heavy perfume scent to it. I ended up returning it without trying it, as perfume makes me sick.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-18","r":5.0,"t":"Almost every color shows up great on my skin","x":"I was so surprised on how pigmented it was! Almost every color shows up great on my skin. There was a slightly weird smell but I didn't mind at all.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-19","r":3.0,"t":"Just meh","x":"The colors are not as nice as they looked in the pic and the pigmentation is not great.  It takes several coats and it wears of fast.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-20","r":2.0,"t":"The pigment is not very strong in this eyeshadow, ...","x":"The pigment is not very strong in this eyeshadow, taking much more powder than expected to achieve the color on the palette.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-21","r":3.0,"t":"Not quite the colors that were portrayed in the picture ...","x":"Not quite the colors that were portrayed in the picture. Had to send back because it wasn't quite what I was looking for","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-22","r":1.0,"t":"No just don't.","x":"Hardly any pigment and smells like baby powder. Mine also didn't come with a brush lie the picture shows.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-23","r":4.0,"t":"Good dupe for Urban decay Heat","x":"Value product if you are on a budget with reasonable Color payoff and beautiful Color selection","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B073WVN4WV-24","r":2.0,"t":"Didn\u2019t look at all like the shades in photo","x":"Colors were much more orange than pink tones. Didn\u2019t look at all like the shades in photo.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers say the colors do not match the online photos, appearing lighter, more vivid, or different in person.","cites":[1,2,3,4,6,11]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the product arrived damaged, smudged, or looking used.","cites":[6,7]},{"text":"A number of reviewers complain about a strong, unpleasant smell.","cites":[3,7,9]},{"text":"Some reviewers praise the product's longevity and staying power.","cites":[1,13,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the eyeshadow dry, low in pigmentation, or difficult to apply.","cites":[8,12,14]}]},"qa":[]}